  "answer": "The Pacemaker Day (workshop pcmk-day-nov19, code x4pqt) is not built from the regular catalog item. Its catalog_item is rhel-ha.pacemaker-lab.event, the event stage.\n\nThe component rhel-ha.pacemaker-lab.event on whimbrel specifies:\n- ha_node: 2 x c7i.large cluster nodes (plus 1 t3a.small bastion)\n- scm_ref: pcmk-lab-3.2.0\n- defined in rhel-ha/pacemaker-lab/event.yaml\n\nSo each attendee gets a 2-node cluster. The lab guide matches the prod stage instead, rhel-ha.pacemaker-lab.prod, which builds 3 m6a.xlarge nodes from pcmk-lab-3.4.1. Looking up the component by the bare name rhel-ha.pacemaker-lab returns that prod stage, which is the wrong one for this workshop.\n"
